e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7-fqFmHFwUoQ7kNvwH9pWtt&_nc_oc=AdqIi_VzJ0qfg-7oVSaoVK4uejMQ3cY34D4QuQErOyuslkU39nT-WeTIAUEYser8m4w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0WiEVV41OjUwb6jxvVURwta7a4IcV9rveugvn6HwODIA&oe=69ECA0B9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6OoUYu5PDvUQ7kNvwFeNFzG&_nc_oc=AdoF0ckuTaTKoG0fCOpAI-BJxo8CWVs63w01ej6xV1T5Irj5jnGELItNwg_7sBtaUmA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0_-syRFooXQl2sjgZTvJP2fouHBB7HCoWIeJEjBR55ew&oe=69ECB053"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V5VOK8r-1ngQ7kNvwHWDBHG&_nc_oc=AdpRwqZZ_ybMkmPhNrcVOuHjhpWaClsnLty2q_k39jouwEIUfMO53N0ukxptSVn5yQM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0SG6HfvyvNVG5FL1h7T0wKsnAHP8nLU5a2_675pwKplA&oe=69ECBBFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4YCvzjKjGUAQ7kNvwFJ6i67&_nc_oc=Ado3aCR3mmIHwhLLO0tPfANUDOZCcRWGgo30rxOvmqVyP4XJXgU8MXnmPMHJsXyfhFM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af25PrziEgn5oZJe8DsTIMKb6iRnj91Hl9a2Dz0XYFaByw&oe=69ECBD4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SE38edyojfkQ7kNvwEs38nu&_nc_oc=AdqqZoiivEN0alqPT10gT7uzB5bhRP0-TH2QTUspL0pyu_KyY8rh6rPLRjGArOHbVFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2uakvXcamjJmHWszFGKIf8BjSqsgk0nscZ-gbSzisCZQ&oe=69ECA67E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se